{"unit_id":"tancheng33__dsh-ontology#card-zh","repo":"tancheng33/dsh-ontology","commit":"ca2399ace40e97c5d61b5e47243984fa00e33081","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ontology 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的持久化知识图谱插件，适合需要让 agent 跨会话保存结构化领域知识的场景。它在 DSH 中注册定义、断言、查询和撤回四个工具，并将当前词汇摘要加入系统提示。用户可以声明类和带类型的关系，按领域与值域校验实体事实，通过对称、逆关系和传递关系推导事实，也可按类、文本、三元组、邻域或路径查询。图谱保存在 DSH storage domain；无需额外 API key，需支持 storage-domain 的 DSH 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:79-107","src/tools.ts:866-872","src/ontology.ts:674-773","src/store.ts:437-472"]}
{"unit_id":"tancheng33__dsh-ontology#card-en","repo":"tancheng33/dsh-ontology","commit":"ca2399ace40e97c5d61b5e47243984fa00e33081","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ontology adds a typed graph to DSH. Its tools define classes and relations, validate facts, query entities or paths, and retract records. Queries can infer inverse, symmetric, and transitive facts. A prompt section can summarize the vocabulary. It uses DSH storage and needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:79-107","src/tools.ts:866-872","src/ontology.ts:674-773","src/store.ts:437-472"]}
